MNews "pre 2" -- why this tree is here======================================Ulrich Dessauer's MNews as released in January 1993 ("MNews - pre 2.Release", inst.prf), from TELECOM/mtp.lzh in the Microware OS-9 archive,where it is the MNEWS directory.  It is here, whole and unchanged, becausetass (CMDS/tass, source SRC/tass) links this package's 8BIT library, andthe package's terms (Copyright, and inst.prf section 1) allow it to beredistributed only whole, in source, with its notice.Nothing in this tree is changed.  One thing is built from it: LIB/8bit.l,from 8BIT/inp.c, conv.c and c8type.c (tools/rebuild/recipes.psv).  None ofpre-2's own programs -- inews, rnews, sbatch and the rest -- is built: thedisk's news system is the earlier prerelease in CMDS/MNEWS, whose programscarry the same names.MANIFEST lists two files the archive does not contain: INEWS/RELS andMAN/Manuals.t.Z.uu.  The manuals are here already formatted, as MAN/*.manwith their MAN/*.prf sources.